{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_document", "label": "Codex Efficiency Fixes Design (spec)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t1_worker_review_prohibition", "label": "T1: SDD Worker-Review Prohibition", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "9/9 depth-2 spawns across 4 corpora were implementer-issued reviewers, all same-task duplicates of the review the controller dispatches anyway; self-review in the implementer prompt gets reified into a reviewer subagent on spawn-capable harnesses."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t2_event_driven_waiting", "label": "T2: Event-Driven Waiting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "60-78 percent of wait_agent calls time out in every corpus; Codex V2 waits are event subscriptions, not polls - one long wait has the same wake latency as a 10s poll at ~1/90th the calls, and completed children drain into the next model request."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t3_codex_tools_corrections", "label": "T3: codex-tools.md V1/V2 Corrections", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five guidance claims are contradicted by the Codex source: close_agent is V1-only (V2 LRU-evicts), followup_task always resumes the implementer, role files DO attach to spawns, full-history forks accept model overrides, and non-V2 presets hard-error."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t4_three_path_router", "label": "T4: Brainstorming Three-Path Router", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The absolute HARD-GATE wording pushed a bounded task to FULL ceremony 5/5 - absolute phrasing suppresses discrimination the model draws natively; the measured waste is the unconditional two-document ritual, so the router scales the artifact (spike/bounded/architectural) while every path keeps human approval."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t5_explicit_model_spawns", "label": "T5: Explicit Model on Child-Issued Spawns", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Root spawns are 100 percent explicit-model but 2/2 child-issued spawns omitted model; model without reasoning_effort resets effort to the MODEL's default - every spawn at every depth sets both, with config.toml defaults as machine-level backstop."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t1_worker_review_prohibition", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t2_event_driven_waiting", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t3_codex_tools_corrections", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t4_three_path_router", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t5_explicit_model_spawns", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fixes_design_t1_worker_review_prohibition", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_03_23_codex_app_compatibility_design_subagent_driven_development_skill", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-codex-efficiency-fixes-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_30_codex_efficiency_fix